  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cot</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sec</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and the quadrant in which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;lies, respectively are",
    "image": null
  },
